+### Deploying to Wasmer Edge
+
+[Import into Wasmer](https://wasmer.io/apps/create?github=madrilene%2Feleventy-excellent) to build and host the `dist` output on Wasmer Edge. The link imports this public repository; it does not copy it into your GitHub account, so import your own copy or fork to customize the site and redeploy on push. The headers in `netlify.toml` / `vercel.json` and the Netlify `_redirects` file are not applied by Wasmer.
